# Build context for every Dockerfile in this repo (Fly apps and the Apify Actor). They COPY only
# src/, deploy/, skills/, team/, .actor/ and requirements.txt, so everything else stays home: output/
# carries seller data and runs to gigabytes, and .env carries every key.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.skills.example
.git/
.venv/
venv/
output/
logs/
archive/
dist/
node_modules/
Skills for REI/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
*.mp4
*.mov
*.xlsx
*.pdf
